# AI SDK Integration

This repository publishes two npm packages with versioned Vercel AI SDK entrypoints:

- **`@jerome-benoit/sap-ai-provider`** — V3 root plus `/v2`, `/v3`, and `/v4` entrypoints
- **`@jerome-benoit/sap-ai-provider-v2`** — standalone V2 facade

Use `/v2` with AI SDK 5, the root or identical `/v3` entrypoint with AI SDK 6, and `/v4`
with AI SDK 7. The V2 facade also supports AI SDK 6 compatibility. Package
release versions, provider specifications (V2/V3/V4), and AI SDK majors
(5/6/7) are separate version axes.

## V3 Root Entrypoint (AI SDK 6)

The root entrypoint implements `ProviderV3`, `LanguageModelV3`, and `EmbeddingModelV3` contracts.
The explicit `/v3` subpath shares the root runtime and declarations; it is not a facade.

| Method                                 | Description                        |
| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `provider(modelId)`                    | Create a language model            |
| `provider.chat(modelId)`               | Create a language model (alias)    |
| `provider.languageModel(modelId)`      | Create a language model (explicit) |
| `provider.embedding(modelId)`          | Create an embedding model          |
| `provider.embeddingModel(modelId)`     | Create an embedding model (alias)  |
| `provider.textEmbeddingModel(modelId)` | Create an embedding model (alias)  |

**Source files:**

- [src/sap-ai-provider.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-provider.ts)
- [src/sap-ai-language-model.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-language-model.ts)
- [src/sap-ai-embedding-model.ts](mdc:src/sap-ai-embedding-model.ts)

## V4 Facade Entrypoint

The `/v4` subpath wraps the V3 core and implements `ProviderV4`,
`LanguageModelV4`, and `EmbeddingModelV4` for AI SDK 7. Prompt and result
shape differences are isolated in the V4 adapters. It exposes the same callable,
chat, language-model, and embedding methods listed for V3 above. V4-only shapes
without a supported conversion are rejected; the shared core can ignore other
unsupported parts with warnings. See the adapters for supported conversions.

